{"tts": [{"out": "gelen/ruya/b02/s01_0_NARRATOR.mp3", "voice": "Brian", "lang": "en", "text": "Night two. Six nights left to bring a runaway dream home.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b02/s03_0_MIRA.mp3", "voice": "Jessica", "lang": "en", "text": "Theo? What are you doing here?", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b02/s04_0_THEO.mp3", "voice": "Liam", "lang": "en", "text": "You saw the singing snow too. I'm coming with you. No arguments.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b02/s05_0_THEO.mp3", "voice": "Liam", "lang": "en", "text": "So\u2026 where exactly are we going?", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b02/s05_1_MIRA.mp3", "voice": "Jessica", "lang": "en", "text": "Somewhere you won't believe.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b02/s07_0_THEO.mp3", "voice": "Liam", "lang": "en", "text": "Okay. Okay. I believe you.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b02/s08_0_ELIAS.mp3", "voice": "Bill", "lang": "en", "text": "You brought a friend. The Archive does not usually allow guests.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b02/s10_0_ELIAS.mp3", "voice": "Bill", "lang": "en", "text": "But the jars are humming for him. So\u2026 welcome, young man.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b02/s11_0_ELIAS.mp3", "voice": "Bill", "lang": "en", "text": "If you are going to help, you must know the three rules of the Archive.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b02/s12_0_ELIAS.mp3", "voice": "Bill", "lang": "en", "text": "Rule one. Never open a jar that is not yours.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b02/s13_0_MIRA.mp3", "voice": "Jessica", "lang": "en", "text": "It opened by itself. I promise.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b02/s14_0_ELIAS.mp3", "voice": "Bill", "lang": "en", "text": "Rule two. A dream outside its jar grows weaker in daylight. And stranger.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b02/s15_0_THEO.mp3", "voice": "Liam", "lang": "en", "text": "Stranger like\u2026 singing snow?", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b02/s16_0_ELIAS.mp3", "voice": "Bill", "lang": "en", "text": "Exactly like that. Rule three. Never let the Shadow catch a dream.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b02/s17_0_MIRA.mp3", "voice": "Jessica", "lang": "en", "text": "The man in the hat. I saw him on the school roof.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b02/s19_0_ELIAS.mp3", "voice": "Bill", "lang": "en", "text": "He collects lost dreams and silences them. If he catches yours, it is gone forever.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b02/s20_0_ELIAS.mp3", "voice": "Bill", "lang": "en", "text": "Every jar is written here. Whose dream it is, and when it was dreamed.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b02/s22_0_MIRA.mp3", "voice": "Jessica", "lang": "en", "text": "Someone tore it out. The name for our jar is missing.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b02/s23_0_THEO.mp3", "voice": "Liam", "lang": "en", "text": "Please tell me the Shadow can't read.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b02/s25_0_MIRA.mp3", "voice": "Jessica", "lang": "en", "text": "It's ringing. The dream is close!", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b02/s27_0_ELIAS.mp3", "voice": "Bill", "lang": "en", "text": "Careful! Stay where the jars are bright!", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b02/s29_0_MIRA.mp3", "voice": "Jessica", "lang": "en", "text": "Hey\u2026 it's okay. I'm not going to hurt you.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b02/s32_0_MIRA.mp3", "voice": "Jessica", "lang": "en", "text": "I\u2026 I know this. I've seen this before.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b02/s34_0_THEO.mp3", "voice": "Liam", "lang": "en", "text": "Mira. Behind us.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b02/s36_0_ELIAS.mp3", "voice": "Bill", "lang": "en", "text": "Away from them! The children are under my protection!", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b02/s38_0_NARRATOR.mp3", "voice": "Brian", "lang": "en", "text": "Five nights left. And Mira was beginning to remember.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}]}